    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Presence of settlements'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='25584' id='3' name='Presence of settlements in Early Helladic' w='57040' x='851' y='1402' />
        <zone h='27687' id='5' name='Presence of settlements in Middle Helladic' w='57826' x='589' y='21963' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='24182' id='6' type-v2='text' w='47151' x='2816' y='46145'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>The data shows an increase in the presence of settlements from the Early to the Middle Helladic period, alongside a notable decrease in the presence of cemeteries.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>This contrast may indicate changes in settlement organization and the spatial relationship between habitation and burial practices, suggesting a possible restructuring of social or ritual landscapes during the Middle Helladic period.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
