        <zone h='24065' id='10' type-v2='text' w='42829' x='1310' y='62383'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Dominance of summit &amp; ridge → increases over time</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Implication:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> The distribution of topographic positions shows a strong and increasing preference for elevated locations from the Early to the Middle Helladic period.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Summits and ridges dominate in both periods, with their combined proportion rising in the Middle Helladic period. This suggests a growing emphasis on highly elevated and potentially more defensible or visible locations.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
